NOTE ON THE CONTENTS OF THIS REPOSITORY

This MIT licence covers the replication code, the experiment harnesses, the
report/figure scripts and the committed per-seed result CSVs.

It does NOT cover `paper/`, which contains the official ReScience C article
template redistributed under its own terms:

  * template files (`rescience.cls`, `header.tex`, `article.tex`, `Makefile`,
    `yaml-to-latex.py`, `article.py`) — GPL-3 or later, (C) 2015-2020
    Nicolas Rougier and co-authors; see `paper/COPYING`;
  * bundled fonts — Apache License 2.0 (Roboto) and the SIL Open Font License
    (Source Serif/Sans/Code Pro); see the licence file inside each font
    directory.

The article text itself is published by ReScience C under a Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC-BY-4.0).

MNIST and CIFAR-10 are not redistributed here; the data loaders fetch them from
their original sources at run time.
